{"candidate_id": "cand-ap-factcrescendo-0010", "factchecker": "factcrescendo.com", "factcheck_article": "https://english.factcrescendo.com/2022/01/07/did-sachin-tendulkar-attend-social-worker-sindhutai-sapkals-funeral/", "social_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QHiBAL50JxM", "media_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QHiBAL50JxM", "platform": "youtube", "media_type": "photo", "ground_truth_claim": null, "ground_truth_label": null, "claim_type": "provenance", "language": "en", "eligibility_status": "REJECTED", "rejection_reason": "Judged NOT the misinformation source (conf=0.00): [[\"The viral image is three years old showing Sachin Tendulkar offering his help to his childhood cricket coach and mentor Ramakant Achrekar at his funeral in 2019.\", \"Sindhutai Sapkal\u2019s cremation- Sindhutai Sapkal was cremated at Thosar Paga cemetery on Wednesday (5 January).\"]]\n\n[\"Fact Check-\nThe Indian Express published this image on 3 January 2019 stating that the image shows Sachin Tendulkar at the funeral of his childhood coach Ramakant Achrekar who passed away due to age-related ailments.\", \"Ramakant Achrekar, who was a Dronacharya and Padmi Shri awardee,\nwas 87 years old. At his funeral,\nt tendulkar had given his shoulder during the cremation process.\"]]\n\n[\"Conclusion-\nThe viral image shows Sachin Tendulkar giving a shoulder to his childhood cricket coach Ramakant Achrekar at his funeral in 2019.\", \"The image is three years old. The image has no relation with Sindhutai Sapkal\u2019s cremation in Pune.\"]]\n\n[\"Did Sachin Tendulkar attend social worker Sindhutai Sapkal\u2019s funeral?\"]", "judge_confidence": null, "history": [{"status": "DISCOVERED", "at": "2026-09-07T13:30:36.344377+00:00", "note": "created"}, {"status": "SOCIAL_REFERENCE_FOUND", "at": "2026-09-07T13:30:36.344433+00:00", "note": "youtube ref via mass_source_allplatform.py"}, {"status": "MEDIA_RETRIEVABLE", "at": "2026-09-07T13:30:39.117953+00:00", "note": "uploader=@TV9MarathiLive caption=True video=False"}, {"status": "REJECTED", "at": "2026-09-07T13:31:46.711940+00:00", "note": "llama3.2: [[\"The viral image is three years old showing Sachin Tendulkar offering his help to his childhood cricket coach and mentor Ramakant Achrekar at his funeral in 2019.\", \"Sindhutai Sapkal\u2019s cremation- Sindhutai Sapkal was cremated at Thosar Paga cemetery on Wednesday (5 January).\"]]\n\n[\"Fact Check-\nThe Indian Express published this image on 3 January 2019 stating that the image shows Sachin Tendulkar at the funeral of his childhood coach Ramakant Achrekar who passed away due to age-related ailments.\", \"Ramakant Achrekar, who was a Dronacharya and Padmi Shri awardee,\nwas 87 years old. At his funeral,\nt tendulkar had given his shoulder during the cremation process.\"]]\n\n[\"Conclusion-\nThe viral image shows Sachin Tendulkar giving a shoulder to his childhood cricket coach Ramakant Achrekar at his funeral in 2019.\", \"The image is three years old. The image has no relation with Sindhutai Sapkal\u2019s cremation in Pune.\"]]\n\n[\"Did Sachin Tendulkar attend social worker Sindhutai Sapkal\u2019s funeral?\"]"}]}
